WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.210
"Three Summers since I chose
a maid," a farmer tells us.

2
00:00:04.260 --> 00:00:06.030
Too young, maybe.

3
00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:08.980
At harvest, there was
no time to court her.

4
00:00:09.030 --> 00:00:11.610
After the wedding, she turned afraid.

5
00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:14.870
And one autumn night, she ran away.

6
00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:16.980
Lanterns cross the field.

7
00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:20.560
Later, a door closes, and a key turns.

8
00:00:20.610 --> 00:00:21.920
She fears him.

9
00:00:21.970 --> 00:00:23.670
He longs for her.

10
00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:25.940
So who should we pity?

11
00:00:25.990 --> 00:00:30.620
In this mission, you'll hear the whole
story in the farmer's own voice and dialect:

12
00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:32.490
a dramatic monologue.

13
00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:35.500
You'll follow the night of the
chase, and the locked door.

14
00:00:35.550 --> 00:00:38.100
And you'll climb to
the end, where he says:

15
00:00:38.150 --> 00:00:40.690
"'Tis but a stair Betwixt us."

16
00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:43.740
Your mission: decide who we should pity.
